  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "We apply the options to the given equation & solve it by using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nGiven Equation: 264 + 24 × 9 ÷ 60 – 4 = 630.\n\nNow, Interchanging the numbers and sign:\n\nOption 1) 264 and 9, ÷ and −\n\n9 + 24 × 264 - __**60 ÷ 4**__ = 630\n\n9 + __**24 × 264**__ - 15 = 630\n\n__**9 + **__**__6336__** - 15 = 630\n\n__**6345 - 15**__ = 630\n\n6330 ≠ 630\n\nLHS ≠ RHS.\n\nOption 2) 264 and 9, + and –\n\n9 - 24 × __**264 ÷ 60**__ + 4 = 630\n\n9 - __**24 × 4.4**__ + 4 = 630\n\n__**9**__ - 105.6 __**+**____** 4**__ = 630\n\n__**13 - 105.6**__ = 630 \n\n-92.6 ≠ 630\n\nLHS ≠ RHS.\n\n**Option 3) 4 and 24, ÷ and +**\n\n__**264 ÷ 4**__ × 9 + 60 – 24 = 630\n\n__**66 **____**× 9**__ + 60 – 24 = 630\n\n__**594 +**____** 60**__ – 24 = 630\n\n__**654 – 24**__ = 630\n\n**630 = 630**\n\n**LHS = RHS.**\n\nOption 4) 4 and 9, − and ×\n\n264 + 24 - __**4 ÷ 60**__ × 9 = 630\n\n264 + 24 - **__0.06__**__** × 9**__ = 630\n\n__**264 + 24**__ - 0.59 = 630\n\n__**288 - 0.59**__ = 630\n\n287.41 ≠ 630\n\nLHS ≠ RHS.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
